# Context trim for the repo-root-context images: the app image
# (-f app/Dockerfile) and the derived proxy-policy image
# (-f infra/proxy-policy/Dockerfile — needs services/proxy-policy, re-included
# below; last matching pattern wins, so its junk is re-excluded after the
# negation).
.git
.github
.claude
.superpowers
.agents
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/storybook-static
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
services
!services/proxy-policy
services/proxy-policy/.venv
services/proxy-policy/**/__pycache__
services/proxy-policy/.pytest_cache
services/proxy-policy/.ruff_cache
services/proxy-policy/tests
services/proxy-policy/uv.lock
tests
infra
*.md
*.pptx
